@baseUrl = https://localhost:7179

### 1) List all fly
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Accept: application/json

### 2) Add new fly
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightNumber": "TK2024",
  "origin": "IST",
  "destination": "ESB",
  "departureTime": "2026-11-01T09:00:00Z",
  "arrivalTime": "2026-11-01T10:10:00Z",
  "totalSeats": 180,
  "price": 1500.129
}

### 3) Add second fly
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightNumber": "PC1102",
  "origin": "SAW",
  "destination": "ADB",
  "departureTime": "2026-11-02T14:30:00Z",
  "arrivalTime": "2026-11-02T15:40:00Z",
  "totalSeats": 189,
  "price": 1200
}

### 4) Bring with id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flights/1

### 5) Update (price and clock changed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/flights/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightNumber": "TK2024",
  "origin": "IST",
  "destination": "ESB",
  "departureTime": "2026-11-01T11:00:00Z",
  "arrivalTime": "2026-11-01T12:10:00Z",
  "totalSeats": 180,
  "price": 1750
}

### 6) Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/flights/4

### 7) Olmayan uçuş
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flights/999

### 8) Saçma veri (Deney 4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightNumber": "",
  "origin": "IST",
  "destination": "IST",
  "departureTime": "2020-01-01T10:00:00Z",
  "arrivalTime": "2019-01-01T10:00:00Z",
  "totalSeats": -50,
  "price": -100
}